1
00:00:20,684 --> 00:00:22,314
Kobato, it's all in pieces.

2
00:00:22,314 --> 00:00:23,984
Oh? I'm sorry!

3
00:00:23,984 --> 00:00:26,924
Do we get to have cake from Bakery Tirol
for Christmas again this year?

4
00:00:27,054 --> 00:00:28,294
Oh, yes.

5
00:00:28,294 --> 00:00:29,694
Santa will come, won't he?

6
00:00:30,024 --> 00:00:30,924
I'm sure he will.

7
00:00:30,924 --> 00:00:32,894
What are you doing, Yuzuru?

8
00:00:32,894 --> 00:00:35,464
I'm making it so that it will fit lots of presents.

9
00:00:35,464 --> 00:00:37,024
Let me help you!

10
00:00:42,474 --> 00:00:44,134
Oww...

11
00:00:46,374 --> 00:00:47,774
I-I'm sorry!

12
00:00:50,684 --> 00:00:51,774
Never mind.

13
00:01:01,694 --> 00:01:04,824
Kobato.

14
00:01:04,824 --> 00:01:07,664
Kobato.
What should I do?

15
00:01:07,664 --> 00:01:12,064
Kobato.
Even the most obvious of things

16
00:01:12,964 --> 00:01:16,274
Are always such a challenge

17
00:01:16,274 --> 00:01:19,044
I want to laugh when I'm happy

18
00:01:19,044 --> 00:01:23,344
And sing whenever I want

19
00:01:23,914 --> 00:01:26,344
Is all

20
00:01:27,654 --> 00:01:32,014
They say my dreams will come true someday

21
00:01:32,454 --> 00:01:35,724
But when will "someday" come?

22
00:01:35,724 --> 00:01:39,214
I can't wait forever

23
00:01:39,364 --> 00:01:45,134
On "1, 2, 3!" I'll spread open my arms

24
00:01:45,134 --> 00:01:50,344
And let the light gather around me

25
00:01:50,344 --> 00:01:53,174
Where is it?

26
00:01:53,174 --> 00:01:56,514
Please tell me what I can do

27
00:01:56,514 --> 00:01:59,344
I make the most of getting hurt

28
00:01:59,344 --> 00:02:02,254
And run with all my might

29
00:02:02,254 --> 00:02:06,224
Despite how many dozens of times I fall

30
00:02:06,224 --> 00:02:09,254
And start crying

31
00:02:09,254 --> 00:02:13,284
I surprise myself

32
00:02:13,764 --> 00:02:17,924
In how much I believe in tomorrow

33
00:02:33,144 --> 00:02:36,144
That outfit... it's a Santa suit, isn't it?

34
00:02:36,514 --> 00:02:40,924
Yes. Fujimoto dresses up as
Santa for us every year.

35
00:02:42,254 --> 00:02:43,984
Who else is there?

36
00:02:45,724 --> 00:02:47,624
You're right. Thank you.

37
00:02:56,174 --> 00:02:56,334
...White Christmas.

38
00:02:56,334 --> 00:03:00,944
...White Christmas.
I wonder if Fujimoto is still angry with me.

39
00:03:00,944 --> 00:03:01,874
...White Christmas.

40
00:03:01,874 --> 00:03:02,974
Dobato.

41
00:03:03,214 --> 00:03:04,044
Yes?

42
00:03:04,044 --> 00:03:06,514
We don't have time to be worried
about that right now, do we?

43
00:03:07,454 --> 00:03:08,414
Yes?

44
00:03:09,384 --> 00:03:11,724
The kompeito! Do you remember?!

45
00:03:11,724 --> 00:03:13,654
Y-Yes sir!

46
00:03:16,124 --> 00:03:17,254
Kobato?

47
00:03:19,864 --> 00:03:21,334
Domoto.

48
00:03:21,694 --> 00:03:24,894
I've been waiting. It's been a long
day for you, hasn't it?

49
00:03:25,164 --> 00:03:26,994
Oh, I'm fine!

50
00:03:28,534 --> 00:03:29,664
I'll walk you home.

51
00:03:30,544 --> 00:03:31,834
If you don't mind, that is.

52
00:03:32,174 --> 00:03:33,304
Oh of course not.

53
00:03:34,144 --> 00:03:35,614
Thank you very much.

54
00:03:40,614 --> 00:03:43,274
Christmas is so sparkly and pretty.

55
00:03:43,684 --> 00:03:47,624
It is. Kobato, is there something
that you're wishing for?

56
00:03:47,924 --> 00:03:49,854
Huh? Wishing for?

57
00:03:50,494 --> 00:03:56,264
Well, thanks to the bazaar, there was enough
money to buy new toys. Hmm...

58
00:03:57,004 --> 00:04:00,734
Then can I choose something
that I think will suit you?

59
00:04:01,874 --> 00:04:02,894
A present.

60
00:04:03,474 --> 00:04:05,034
For me?

61
00:04:05,974 --> 00:04:07,374
Sure. It's Christmas.

62
00:04:09,244 --> 00:04:10,734
I wonder what you'd like.

63
00:04:18,984 --> 00:04:22,284
Hey, you're sure working hard.
Even during Christmas?

64
00:04:23,764 --> 00:04:27,254
I don't mind. Christmas doesn't
mean anything to me anyway.

65
00:04:28,564 --> 00:04:29,894
Is something wrong?

66
00:04:30,234 --> 00:04:31,494
Nothing's wrong.

67
00:04:33,304 --> 00:04:34,234
Kobato?

68
00:04:34,904 --> 00:04:35,994
Nothing!

69
00:04:41,774 --> 00:04:44,304
Guess we'd better get going. See you around.

70
00:04:53,024 --> 00:04:57,224
Kobato, I see you still haven't
reconciled with Fujimoto.

71
00:04:58,324 --> 00:05:02,994
I don't know. I don't think he likes me anymore.

72
00:05:04,804 --> 00:05:07,394
He's not like he usually is.

73
00:05:08,304 --> 00:05:10,474
He doesn't say nasty things anymore.

74
00:05:10,474 --> 00:05:12,304
He won't even look at me.

75
00:05:13,274 --> 00:05:14,244
Is that right?

76
00:05:14,914 --> 00:05:18,604
It's been on my mind... for a long time.

77
00:05:23,314 --> 00:05:24,914
You've done nothing wrong, Kobato.

78
00:05:25,484 --> 00:05:27,544
And I'm sure Fujimoto would agree.

79
00:05:28,394 --> 00:05:30,984
He just doesn't know how to admit it.

80
00:05:33,794 --> 00:05:35,194
So don't worry about it.

81
00:05:37,934 --> 00:05:39,194
Okay.

82
00:05:43,104 --> 00:05:44,874
Thank you very much.

83
00:05:44,874 --> 00:05:46,064
My pleasure.

84
00:05:47,344 --> 00:05:48,974
Can I see you again tomorrow?

85
00:05:49,174 --> 00:05:51,314
Huh? Ah, sure.

86
00:05:51,314 --> 00:05:53,904
Then I'll wait for you in front of the kindergarten.

87
00:05:55,254 --> 00:05:56,984
Oh, no. It would be too cold.

88
00:05:57,654 --> 00:05:58,814
I'll be waiting.

89
00:05:59,054 --> 00:06:01,284
Oh... but...

90
00:06:01,524 --> 00:06:02,784
I'll be all right.

91
00:06:04,924 --> 00:06:06,794
So, see you tomorrow.

92
00:06:09,034 --> 00:06:10,154
Okay.

93
00:06:14,274 --> 00:06:16,534
It's Christmas inside, too.

94
00:06:17,504 --> 00:06:20,474
Oh, Ioryogi-san, I'd better get you a present, too.

95
00:06:20,744 --> 00:06:22,074
What would you like to have?

96
00:06:22,074 --> 00:06:24,384
Kompeito! A whole bottle full of them!

97
00:06:24,384 --> 00:06:26,544
I-I know that!

98
00:06:26,544 --> 00:06:27,844
Oh, I know.

99
00:06:28,314 --> 00:06:31,914
This. I made it for you, Ioryogi-san! Here!

100
00:06:34,254 --> 00:06:37,884
Yay! Ioryogi-san has turned into a reindeer!

101
00:06:40,224 --> 00:06:42,694
Dobato!

102
00:06:46,764 --> 00:06:50,224
Whew. Give me a break.

103
00:07:01,384 --> 00:07:03,874
Oh no! I'm late!

104
00:07:03,984 --> 00:07:05,544
Good morning.

105
00:07:05,884 --> 00:07:07,874
Oh, good morning!

106
00:07:08,224 --> 00:07:11,024
You're earlier than usual today, Kobato.

107
00:07:11,024 --> 00:07:14,194
Yes. I need to prepare for the Christmas party.

108
00:07:14,334 --> 00:07:15,454
I see.

109
00:07:15,864 --> 00:07:19,234
Kobato, if you're free this
evening, please come over.

110
00:07:19,234 --> 00:07:20,664
We're having our own Christmas party.

111
00:07:20,974 --> 00:07:23,094
Mother is going to cook a big meal for us.

112
00:07:23,534 --> 00:07:24,944
Please join us if you can.

113
00:07:24,944 --> 00:07:27,234
Yes. Thank you very much.

114
00:07:37,354 --> 00:07:39,884
Good morning.

115
00:07:39,884 --> 00:07:42,384
Oh, you too, Fujimoto. Please come.

116
00:07:42,494 --> 00:07:44,154
Come to our Christmas party.

117
00:07:45,194 --> 00:07:49,424
I have to work tonight. Besides, Christmas...

118
00:07:51,104 --> 00:07:53,894
Then, good luck with your job. Have a good day.

119
00:07:59,244 --> 00:08:01,934
Move along now. You need to get going, too.

120
00:08:02,314 --> 00:08:03,114
Okay!

121
00:08:03,114 --> 00:08:03,784
See you later!
Okay!

122
00:08:03,784 --> 00:08:04,614
See you later!

123
00:08:10,754 --> 00:08:12,014
Kobato?

124
00:08:12,454 --> 00:08:18,014
Everyone is so excited about Christmas,
but Fujimoto seems sad.

125
00:08:18,894 --> 00:08:23,354
It's all my fault. The other day,
I shouldn't have...

126
00:08:25,534 --> 00:08:26,664
That's not it.

127
00:08:30,204 --> 00:08:36,504
It was Christmas Eve one year
when Fujimoto became alone.

128
00:08:57,364 --> 00:08:59,524
Merry Christmas!
To Mother

129
00:09:30,164 --> 00:09:31,634
Mother!

130
00:09:37,604 --> 00:09:39,074
Mother!

131
00:09:40,474 --> 00:09:42,204
Are you all right, dear?

132
00:09:44,844 --> 00:09:46,944
I'm... fine.

133
00:09:47,354 --> 00:09:49,344
You are? That's good.

134
00:10:30,424 --> 00:10:34,764
Fujimoto's mother never
came home since that day.

135
00:10:38,534 --> 00:10:44,204
Shortly after that, Fujimoto was
taken in by Sayaka's father.

136
00:11:13,034 --> 00:11:14,974
Sorry I'm late.

137
00:11:14,974 --> 00:11:18,604
No worries. Now. Shall we begin the party?

138
00:11:20,544 --> 00:11:21,944
I'm ready.

139
00:11:22,814 --> 00:11:24,284
Then Fujimoto.

140
00:11:24,284 --> 00:11:26,274
Wait until everyone calls you and then come in.

141
00:11:26,714 --> 00:11:28,044
Okay.

142
00:11:28,754 --> 00:11:29,714
Kobato.

143
00:11:29,714 --> 00:11:30,914
Yes.

144
00:11:31,154 --> 00:11:32,644
We can go as soon as you're ready.

145
00:11:46,004 --> 00:11:47,234
Kobato?

146
00:11:49,334 --> 00:11:52,134
I admire Fujimoto.

147
00:11:52,874 --> 00:11:54,244
Yes.

148
00:11:55,914 --> 00:11:57,174
He's really something.

149
00:12:02,284 --> 00:12:03,874
I'll do my best.

150
00:12:17,034 --> 00:12:18,004
Yes.

151
00:12:20,734 --> 00:12:23,004
Okay everyone, let's call Santa!

152
00:12:23,134 --> 00:12:26,934
Okay! Santa!

153
00:12:29,314 --> 00:12:31,974
Hey it's Santa!
Wow Santa!

154
00:12:33,814 --> 00:12:35,054
Santa really came!

155
00:12:35,054 --> 00:12:36,274
Santa!

156
00:12:41,554 --> 00:12:43,424
Huh? Teacher Fujimoto?

157
00:12:43,994 --> 00:12:45,164
No...

158
00:12:45,164 --> 00:12:46,594
You're Santa, aren't you?

159
00:12:46,994 --> 00:12:48,434
Santa?

160
00:12:48,434 --> 00:12:50,224
Are you Teacher Fujimoto?

161
00:12:51,864 --> 00:12:53,664
This person is Santa!

162
00:12:56,234 --> 00:12:58,334
That's right, isn't it, Santa?

163
00:13:01,074 --> 00:13:05,134
So! Everyone, what do you think Santa
has brought for you today?

164
00:13:07,854 --> 00:13:09,614
Santa! My present!

165
00:13:09,614 --> 00:13:11,314
Please give me my present!

166
00:13:13,484 --> 00:13:15,654
Thank you!

167
00:13:15,654 --> 00:13:17,854
Thank you very much, Santa!

168
00:13:18,024 --> 00:13:21,294
Well then everyone, shall we have some cake?

169
00:13:21,294 --> 00:13:22,854
Yes!

170
00:13:27,504 --> 00:13:28,594
Hmph!

171
00:13:32,704 --> 00:13:34,974
What do you say I go and get my present, too?

172
00:13:46,854 --> 00:13:48,844
Wonderful job, Fujimoto.

173
00:13:49,654 --> 00:13:52,424
I'll tidy up, so you go on ahead.

174
00:13:52,624 --> 00:13:54,764
I mean, it's Christmas and all...

175
00:13:54,764 --> 00:13:56,394
Don't bother going out of your way for me.

176
00:14:24,894 --> 00:14:26,914
Darn. Why should I have to?

177
00:14:27,024 --> 00:14:30,294
Shut up. Christmas is our busiest season.

178
00:14:30,294 --> 00:14:32,004
Always taking advantage of me.

179
00:14:32,004 --> 00:14:34,094
Merry Christmas!

180
00:14:35,174 --> 00:14:36,794
What are you guys up to?

181
00:14:40,074 --> 00:14:41,504
You look pretty good in that.

182
00:14:50,614 --> 00:14:51,774
Hi Kobato!

183
00:14:56,154 --> 00:14:57,784
Kobato?

184
00:15:07,134 --> 00:15:11,504
I see. Fujimoto was holding it
all in because it's Christmas.

185
00:15:12,204 --> 00:15:16,834
I think I made his pain worse.

186
00:15:19,084 --> 00:15:23,104
Now he really hates me.

187
00:15:24,254 --> 00:15:25,374
But why...

188
00:15:27,754 --> 00:15:28,954
Why does it...

189
00:15:29,824 --> 00:15:31,984
Why does that hurt me so much?

190
00:15:42,904 --> 00:15:46,204
He's on your mind that much, is he?

191
00:15:47,274 --> 00:15:49,544
I don't know. It's not intentional.

192
00:15:49,944 --> 00:15:51,374
I just think about him.

193
00:15:52,814 --> 00:15:57,304
I don't know why, but when I think
about him I get a pain in my heart.

194
00:16:00,454 --> 00:16:01,984
I see.

195
00:16:06,964 --> 00:16:08,194
Domoto?

196
00:16:09,494 --> 00:16:14,164
I've finally figured out the best present for you.

197
00:16:23,944 --> 00:16:25,604
Thank you, please come again.

198
00:16:31,854 --> 00:16:33,614
A Christmas present.

199
00:16:34,724 --> 00:16:36,024
Don't get me wrong.

200
00:16:36,024 --> 00:16:37,154
It isn't for you.

201
00:16:37,594 --> 00:16:40,424
I want you to take this up to Kobato.
She's waiting at the lookout.

202
00:16:43,234 --> 00:16:45,394
Go, please. I'll cover for you here.

203
00:16:46,364 --> 00:16:48,464
Wait a minute. Why me?

204
00:16:48,834 --> 00:16:51,894
It's Christmas but she's feeling upset.

205
00:16:52,974 --> 00:16:53,874
So?

206
00:16:53,874 --> 00:16:56,074
It's your attitude that's hurting her!

207
00:16:58,514 --> 00:17:02,384
But Kobato thinks she's to blame.

208
00:17:03,314 --> 00:17:05,114
She wants to apologize to you.

209
00:17:08,154 --> 00:17:10,184
She's waiting up there. Kobato.

210
00:17:11,394 --> 00:17:13,024
She's waiting all alone!

211
00:18:10,284 --> 00:18:11,714
Fujimoto?

212
00:18:12,454 --> 00:18:13,944
It's not your fault.

213
00:18:14,454 --> 00:18:16,284
You did nothing wrong.

214
00:18:16,554 --> 00:18:17,854
You have nothing to feel bad about.

215
00:18:18,324 --> 00:18:19,294
Huh?

216
00:18:19,694 --> 00:18:22,664
So... well, why do you let it
bother you in the first place?

217
00:18:25,504 --> 00:18:30,804
Um... Could you by chance be telling
me that, you are not angry?

218
00:18:31,774 --> 00:18:33,274
I never was mad at you...

219
00:18:33,274 --> 00:18:34,844
...from the very beginning!

220
00:18:34,844 --> 00:18:36,814
B-But now you are! You're angry!

221
00:18:41,084 --> 00:18:43,514
Anyway, just don't worry about it.

222
00:18:47,624 --> 00:18:48,614
Okay.

223
00:18:49,524 --> 00:18:52,464
Oh, right. This is from Domoto.

224
00:18:57,534 --> 00:18:58,904
To Kobato,
Were you able to make up with Fujimoto?
This is my Christmas present to you.

225
00:18:58,904 --> 00:18:59,664
To Kobato,
Were you able to make up with Fujimoto?
This is my Christmas present to you.
Umm...

226
00:18:59,664 --> 00:19:00,154
Umm...

227
00:19:00,664 --> 00:19:03,064
Were you able to make up with Fujimoto?

228
00:19:03,234 --> 00:19:05,604
That is my Christmas present to you.

229
00:19:05,874 --> 00:19:08,244
I'm sorry if this guy is mean to you.

230
00:19:09,074 --> 00:19:10,444
Huh?

231
00:19:10,444 --> 00:19:11,974
Merry Christmas...

232
00:19:14,184 --> 00:19:17,614
Fujimoto, you are my Christmas
present from Domoto?

233
00:19:17,924 --> 00:19:20,654
Kobato, what did Domoto say
when he told you to wait here?

234
00:19:20,924 --> 00:19:24,414
He said he'd bring a present that
would be perfect for me.

235
00:19:28,994 --> 00:19:33,994
Domoto helped us be friends again.

236
00:19:35,674 --> 00:19:36,964
That guy...

237
00:19:39,044 --> 00:19:40,094
Uh, Hey!

238
00:19:40,974 --> 00:19:43,174
Look Fujimoto, snow!

239
00:19:44,014 --> 00:19:45,184
I know what snow looks like.

240
00:19:45,184 --> 00:19:46,474
It's so pretty!

241
00:20:00,394 --> 00:20:06,304
Flowers blossom in the spring

242
00:20:07,004 --> 00:20:12,904
Skies in the summer reach far and wide

243
00:20:14,204 --> 00:20:20,144
Every time I think of this

244
00:20:20,784 --> 00:20:26,774
Precious thoughts spread across in my heart

245
00:20:27,854 --> 00:20:34,364
In the morning when it rains

246
00:20:34,364 --> 00:20:40,194
On those days when the windows stay closed

247
00:20:41,504 --> 00:20:47,664
My heart shimmers with the light

248
00:20:48,344 --> 00:20:54,614
Light shining brightly above the clouds

249
00:20:56,384 --> 00:21:02,754
The voices are calling to me

250
00:21:02,954 --> 00:21:09,324
From way over yonder, from far I can hear

251
00:21:10,094 --> 00:21:13,904
Voices of laughter

252
00:21:13,904 --> 00:21:16,874
Voices of singing

253
00:21:17,204 --> 00:21:24,134
Echoing voices of the wind

254
00:22:11,924 --> 00:22:14,954
Snow can be pretty too, can't it?

255
00:22:17,194 --> 00:22:18,494
Yes!

256
00:22:22,074 --> 00:22:25,274
In happiness and in sadness

257
00:22:25,274 --> 00:22:28,544
In any case, when winter turns to spring...
In happiness and in sadness

258
00:22:28,544 --> 00:22:28,944
In any case, when winter turns to spring...

259
00:22:28,944 --> 00:22:31,414
In all I behold and all that I live for

260
00:22:31,414 --> 00:22:33,544
It'll be time to say goodbye to Dobato.
In all I behold and all that I live for

261
00:22:33,544 --> 00:22:35,074
In all I behold and all that I live for

262
00:22:35,814 --> 00:22:39,824
With my hand in your hand

263
00:22:39,824 --> 00:22:42,954
Your hand in my hand

264
00:22:42,954 --> 00:22:49,834
Together, we are one and whole

265
00:23:01,314 --> 00:23:08,944
Everyone dreams of flying

266
00:23:10,114 --> 00:23:16,214
But they let gravity trick them

267
00:23:16,494 --> 00:23:24,334
Honestly, everyone is already able to fly

268
00:23:26,564 --> 00:23:32,904
I bet the reason that child looks so terribly sad

269
00:23:33,944 --> 00:23:36,814
Is because he

270
00:23:36,814 --> 00:23:43,944
Accidentally lost his shadow somewhere

271
